      "summary": "A security flaw has been discovered in OGRECave Ogre up to 14.4.1.",
      "details": "A security flaw has been discovered in OGRECave Ogre up to 14.4.1. This issue affects the function STBIImageCodec::encode of the file /ogre/PlugIns/STBICodec/src/OgreSTBICodec.cpp of the component Image Handler. The manipulation results in heap-based buffer overflow. The attack is only possible with local access. The exploit has been released to the public and may be exploited.",
